WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.477
Report Builder reports pile up.

00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:08.900
Report groups arrange them in the admin menu like folders, and every report

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.778
can be exported to CSV, Excel or PDF.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:16.599
This video shows how to organize the reports, pin one to the menu,

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:18.540
and export it as a PDF.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.665
Every person who builds reports adds more of them.

00:00:26.665 --> 00:00:32.960
Without a structure, the list grows, and nobody remembers which report answers which question.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.009
A report group works like a folder:

00:00:36.009 --> 00:00:39.598
Sales can hold Regional, which holds the regional reports.

00:00:39.598 --> 00:00:43.467
In the admin menu each group is an item under Reports, with its

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.710
groups first and then its reports.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:50.307
A group shows only when it holds a report you may open, so

00:00:50.307 --> 00:00:52.652
people never see an empty folder.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:56.920
And a report that was a free-text category before is a group now.

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:03.304
Open Reports, Report Groups.

00:01:03.304 --> 00:01:07.717
The list shows each group followed by the groups nested in it, and

00:01:07.717 --> 00:01:09.310
what each one holds.

00:01:09.788 --> 00:01:11.081
Click Add Group.

00:01:11.081 --> 00:01:13.316
Enter the Name, such as Service.

00:01:13.316 --> 00:01:17.608
The Parent group is None for a top-level group, or any group except

00:01:17.608 --> 00:01:19.608
the ones nested in this one.

00:01:20.059 --> 00:01:24.549
Display order puts the lower numbers first among the groups that share a

00:01:24.549 --> 00:01:28.060
parent; groups with the same number are sorted by name.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.039
Click Save.

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:33.719
To nest a group, choose Add a group inside from a group's actions.

00:01:33.719 --> 00:01:38.419
Here Regional goes inside Service, and the list shows it under its parent.

00:01:42.633 --> 00:01:44.612
Open a report in the builder.

00:01:44.612 --> 00:01:48.963
On its Settings tab, the Group list holds every group, nested ones with

00:01:48.963 --> 00:01:52.693
their path, and No group leaves the report out of any group.

00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:57.577
Show in the admin menu adds the report under Reports, inside its group,

00:01:57.577 --> 00:01:59.587
for everyone who can open it.

00:01:59.587 --> 00:02:01.655
Choose the group, and tick it.

00:02:02.129 --> 00:02:06.242
Let people the report is shared with export it decides whether the people

00:02:06.242 --> 00:02:08.325
it is shared with can download it.

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:11.032
Leave it off to let them view the report only.

00:02:11.032 --> 00:02:13.219
Click Publish to apply the settings.

00:02:13.702 --> 00:02:19.228
Under Reports, the Service group now holds Regional, and Regional holds the report.

00:02:19.228 --> 00:02:22.892
A report in no group is added directly under Reports.

00:02:27.138 --> 00:02:28.754
Run the report.

00:02:28.754 --> 00:02:35.066
The Export menu offers Export CSV, Export Excel and Export PDF, depending on

00:02:35.066 --> 00:02:37.452
the features that are on:

00:02:37.452 --> 00:02:43.148
Reports for CSV, Reports OpenXml for Excel, and Reports PDF for PDF.

00:02:43.604 --> 00:02:45.167
Click Export PDF.

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:50.804
The export uses the filters on screen, so the file shows what the page shows.

00:02:52.404 --> 00:02:56.108
The PDF lays the report out as it looks on the page:

00:02:56.108 --> 00:03:02.174
a band for each container, tables with their totals, charts as drawn, and numbered pages.

00:03:06.374 --> 00:03:07.658
A team menu:

00:03:07.658 --> 00:03:14.004
Service, Sales and Finance groups, so each team opens its own reports from Reports.

00:03:14.754 --> 00:03:16.096
A monthly pack:

00:03:16.096 --> 00:03:20.250
a PDF export of the dashboard to hand to a manager who does

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.784
not open the site.

00:03:22.534 --> 00:03:23.598
An upgrade:

00:03:23.598 --> 00:03:29.354
reports that had a category keep their place, as top-level groups with the same names.

00:03:31.354 --> 00:03:35.120
Groups keep the report list in order, and a PDF takes a report

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.335
to people who never open the site.

00:03:37.335 --> 00:03:38.774
Thanks for watching.

